@cartId = {{ '340f2c3b-97de-4426-aeec-87433c1b79c7' }}

### Create cart (optional items — replaces contents if cart already exists)
POST http://localhost:3000/carts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "2f9aa836-072b-41fa-b80b-2f5c106e5ecd",
      "quantity": 3
    }
  ]
}

### List carts
GET http://localhost:3000/carts

### Get cart by id
GET http://localhost:3000/carts/{{cartId}}
### Get cart with items (soft assessment: valid, issues, summary)
GET http://localhost:3000/carts/{{cartId}}?includeItems=true

### Validate cart (hard fail on invalid items; optional coupon / loyalty)
POST http://localhost:3000/carts/{{cartId}}/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "couponCode": "SAVE10",
  "loyaltyPointsAmount": 100
}

### Update cart (replaces full contents — omitted products are removed)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/carts/{{cartId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "a52def5c-2b50-461b-8cc0-a14db7990099",
      "quantity": 2
    },
    {
      "productId": "a60a40b7-c02e-4e66-a205-0e5ac01248a1",
      "quantity": 6
    }
  ]
}

### Clear cart items
PATCH http://localhost:3000/carts/{{cartId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": []
}

### Delete cart
DELETE http://localhost:3000/carts/{{cartId}}
